  "_README": [
    "TAXI FARES — fill this in from a source you trust, then commit.",
    "",
    "Every field marked null is unknown, and the app renders NOTHING it",
    "doesn't have: a route with both fares null never appears, and the whole",
    "screen hides if no route has a fare. So this file is safe to ship",
    "half-filled. It will never invent a number.",
    "",
    "  colectivoUSD  US dollars PER PERSON in a shared taxi. null if unknown.",
    "  privateUSD    US dollars for the WHOLE CAR. null if unknown.",
    "  note          Anything that changes the number. null if nothing does.",
    "",
    "Set 'source' and 'sourceURL' to wherever the numbers came from — the",
    "screen shows it, which is what lets a reader judge the number. Set",
    "'updated' to the date you checked (yyyy-MM-dd); after a year the screen",
    "says so on its own rather than passing off an old fare as today's.",
    "",
    "Routes below are the ones visitors actually take. Add or delete freely;",
    "'id' just has to be unique."
  ],

